# Optional: Dedicated browser API key restricted to the Google Sheets API
# and your allowed HTTP referrers (e.g. https://guest-room-planner.slaks.net/*).
# Used for reading public ("Anyone with the link") shared spreadsheets without login.
# If omitted, the app falls back to the Firebase Web apiKey in firebase-applet-config.json.
VITE_GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY=""
